-</style></head><body><div id="app"><header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><span class="brandmark">♡</span> MOONFALL / A FOLKTALE</div><div>AN INDIE SIDE-SCROLLER · 01</div></header><main><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">A tale of what makes us whole</div><h1>Three Hearts</h1></div><div class="chapter">CHAPTER I<br>THE HOLLOW CROWN</div></div><section class="game-shell" aria-label="Three Hearts game"><div class="hud"><div class="heart-row"><div class="heart-card owned" id="human-heart" title="Human heart"><span class="icon">♥</span><span class="mini-label">HUMAN</span></div><div class="heart-card" id="dark-heart" title="Dark heart"><span class="icon">♥</span><span class="mini-label">DARK</span></div><div class="heart-card" id="wolf-heart" title="Wolf heart"><span class="icon">♥</span><span class="mini-label">WOLF</span></div></div><div class="heart-info"><span class="hud-label">VITALITY</span><div class="health" id="health"></div></div><div class="hud-right"><div class="hud-stat">SHARDS<br><strong id="shards">00 / 06</strong></div><div class="hud-stat">FORM<br><strong id="form">HUMAN</strong></div><button class="soundbtn" id="soundbtn">♫ ON</button></div></div><div class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="game" width="960" height="430" aria-label="Platform game"></canvas><div class="boss-health" id="boss-health"><div class="boss-title">THE HOLLOW KING</div><div class="boss-track"><div class="boss-fill" id="boss-fill"></div></div></div><div class="overlay" id="overlay"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-tag" id="panel-tag">A FOLKTALE IN THREE HEARTS</div><h2 id="panel-title">They took<br>what made him.</h2><p id="panel-copy">The Hollow King stole the Dark Heart and the Wolf Heart, leaving only the human heart beating in his chest. Cross the moonlit wilds. Take them back. Become whole.</p><button class="primary" id="start-btn">BEGIN THE JOURNEY →</button><div class="panel-note" id="panel-note">A / D OR ← / → MOVE · SPACE JUMP · X ATTACK</div></div></div><div class="touch-controls"><div class="touch-cluster"><button class="touch-btn" data-key="left" aria-label="Move left">←</button><button class="touch-btn" data-key="right" aria-label="Move right">→</button></div><div class="touch-cluster"><button class="touch-btn" data-key="wolf" aria-label="Toggle wolf form">🐺</button><button class="touch-btn action" data-key="attack" aria-label="Attack">✦</button><button class="touch-btn jump" data-key="jump" aria-label="Jump">↑</button></div></div></div></section><div class="controls"><div class="control-group"><span><span class="key">A</span><span class="key">D</span> MOVE</span><span><span class="key">SPACE</span> JUMP</span><span><span class="key">X</span> ATTACK</span><span><span class="key">Z</span> WOLF FORM</span></div><div class="right-note"><span class="mobile-hint">TOUCH TO MOVE · </span>COLLECT SHARDS · RECLAIM YOUR HEARTS</div></div></main><footer class="foot"><span>✦ THE MOON REMEMBERS</span><span>© MOONFALL FOLKLORE</span></footer></div>
-<script>
